Synthesis
  14-route: the worst quotient one-defect is coordinate 6, the first
  visible distinct product-sum resonance 1+2+3=6.  Coordinate 12, the
  next rich product-sum target, is second.  This turns the S371 56-cell
  target into a natural-mode fragility problem, not just a residue accident.
  15-route: the best one-defect splits into two tied order-3 stencils,
  coordinate 6 and endpoint coordinate 14.  This matches the 15=3*5 CRT
  split and suggests proving the order-3 stencil pair before attempting
  a full 3x5 micro-staircase.
  disproof-route: product-sum/divisor critical speed sets still all leak.
  The natural-operation candidates produce positive gaps and empty cores,
  so the next counterexample search should solve protection cycles directly
  instead of overloading operation-critical target modes.
